{"id":"04028314a0510b33","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-game2-strategy.md","title":"ZFC Game2 Strategy","display":"df-zfc-game2-strategy — ZFC Game2 Strategy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game2-strategy","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game2-strategy"],"display":"df-zfc-game2-strategy — ZFC Game2 Strategy","depends_on":["[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-game]]","[[58-df-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game2-strategy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game2-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game2-strategy — ZFC Game2 Strategy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2a48a890cd9aeba0\" href=\"?note=2a48a890cd9aeba0\" title=\"58-df-game\">58-df-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,i,T,\\sigma,R_T\\in V\">\\(A,i,T,\\sigma,R_T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a>), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tree}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tree}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2Strategy}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame2Strategy}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}prefix} \\vdash R_T\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\land s=t\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}prefix} \\vdash R_T\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\land s=t\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}strategy} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2Strategy}_S(\\sigma,i,T,A)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\varnothing\\land i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land T\\subseteq\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R_T)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall s\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\land s=t\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\to s\\in T\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\sigma,\\left\\{s\\in T:|\\operatorname{dom}(s)|\\bmod 2=i\\right\\},A\\right)\\land\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;(s^\\frown\\langle\\sigma(s)\\rangle\\in T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}strategy} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2Strategy}_S(\\sigma,i,T,A)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\varnothing\\land i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land T\\subseteq\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R_T)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall s\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\land s=t\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\to s\\in T\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\sigma,\\left\\{s\\in T:|\\operatorname{dom}(s)|\\bmod 2=i\\right\\},A\\right)\\land\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;(s^\\frown\\langle\\sigma(s)\\rangle\\in T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The prefix order and parity-based turn rule are defined from the game tree instead of being hidden ambient parameters; the exact sourced symbol is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tree}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tree}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-game","status":"resolved","id":"2a48a890cd9aeba0","anchor":"ref-3"